      "target": "../sections/sec-front-matter.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Évaluation du lien de causalité \npour les manifestations postvaccinales \nindésirables (MAPI) \nManuel d’utilisation de la classiﬁ cation OMS révisée\n \n \n \n \n \n \nÉVALUATION DU LIEN DE CAUSALITÉ \nPOUR LES \nMANIFESTATIONS POSTVACCINALES \nINDÉSIRABLES \n(MAPI) \n \n \n \nManuel d’utilisation de  \nla classification OMS révisée \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nCatalogage à la source: Bibliothèque de l’OMS: \n \nÉvaluation du lien de causalité pour les manifestations postvaccinales indésirables (MAPI). Manuel d’utilisation de \nla classification OMS révisée. \n \nI.Organisation mondiale de la Santé. \n \nISBN 978 92 4",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Front matter of the French edition of WHO's user manual for the revised classification of causality assessment for adverse events following immunization (AEFI), with title pages, cataloguing data and ISBN, and the 2016 copyright and disclaimer text. It credits the subgroup of the Global Advisory Committee on Vaccine Safety that developed the protocol and notes the concepts draw on the CIOMS/WHO vaccine pharmacovigilance terminology. It also states the manual's purpose and gives the table of contents through the four assessment steps.",
        "state": "draft",
